  <div class="v-content">
    <p class="v-pretitle">Remember, remember…</p>
    <h1 class="v-title">The Engineer<br/>Behind the Mask</h1>

    <div class="v-card">
      <p class="v-lead">I'm <strong>Vuk1lis</strong> - a DevOps engineer, Linux enthusiast, and VibeCoder.</p>
      <p>My work sits at the intersection of art and technology. I build immersive digital experiences where dark aesthetics meet surgical performance. Every deployment is a revolution. Every animation is a statement.</p>
      <p>I don't just write code - I orchestrate infrastructure like a symphony, and craft interfaces that feel like they were pulled from another dimension.</p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="v-quote">
      <span class="q-mark">"</span>
      Viola, viator. A rose by any other name would smell as sweet. Verbi gratia, by any other name would I still be all that I am?
      <span class="q-mark">"</span>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="v-stats">
      <div class="v-stat"><span class="v-num">3+</span><span class="v-label">Years in the shadows</span></div>
      <div class="v-stat"><span class="v-num">40+</span><span class="v-label">Physical Servers liberated</span></div>
      <div class="v-stat"><span class="v-num">∞</span><span class="v-label">Containers unchained</span></div>
